    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Forf">Forf.</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Forfang ofer eal, sy hit on an scire, sy hit on má, fiftyne penegas; 7 ælcon smalon orfe æfre æt scillinge peni.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">[The reward for] the seizure/recovery [of stolen property] is [to be the same] everywhere, be it in one shire, be it in [over] several: 15 pence; and for every small animal a penny shall always be paid per shilling [of the value of the property].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Forfang ubique, sit in una scyre, sit in pluribus, XV den. (sint); et de omni paruo pecore semper pro solido denarius reddatur.</ab>
      </div>
